Third-party notices for charr
=============================

stringi
-------

Charr's initial private backend is copied from stringi's R and C++
implementation. Its original ICU4C vendoring layout and build configuration
were also adapted from stringi. The current ICU4C 78.3 runtime source is a
pristine official import; package-specific settings remain in charr's build
flags and configuration header. Copied stringi files retain their upstream
copyright notices and identify the pinned source commit.

