ICU4C
-----

Charr bundles ICU4C 78.3 source code and data from Unicode, Inc. and others.
The complete Unicode License v3 and ICU third-party notices are included in
`icu/LICENSE` in the installed package and `src/icu78/LICENSE` in the source
package.

